  [   45.8-   48.6] but inflation remains elevated.
  [   49.3-   54.6] The Committee believes that the accumulation of more information will help it determine
  [   54.6-   61.4] the policy stance appropriate to ensure a timely return of inflation to the 2 percent goal.
