  [   67.7-   72.6] colleagues and I assess the economy by looking out the window. It's what we call
  [   72.6-   78.3] interrogating reality. To gauge what's really going on, it is not a task that
  [   78.3-   85.0] has grown easier. So what exactly do we observe? Economic growth has
  [   85.0-   91.2] strengthened. The GDP increase in the first half of this year was revised
